    "answer": {
      "short": "(a) $50.29\\text{ mm}^2$; (b) $28.29\\text{ m}^2$.",
      "worked": "For diameter $8\\text{ mm}$, $r=4\\text{ mm}$, so $A\\approx(\\frac{22}{7})4^2=\\frac{352}{7}\\approx50.29\\text{ mm}^2$. For radius $3\\text{ m}$, $A\\approx(\\frac{22}{7})3^2=\\frac{198}{7}\\approx28.29\\text{ m}^2$.",
